==Notes==

*Deer fight solo, but can be found in herds.
*Deer will destroy anything that obstructs their path if you are on a tile they can get to. If the object in their way has a lower [[Soak]] than 25, it will be destroyed. This essentially means that only [[Palisade]]s and [[Brickwall]]s can stop a Deer from chasing you, although it is also viable to flee onto deep water, since they cannot traverse deep water tiles.

